[{"client_msg_id":"f5b62016-478f-41fe-ad43-a84875e70712","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"です、そしてリモートの状態が良いとは限らないので、みたいな","ts":"1618920295.190800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UPWFF5YQ7"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2OHoG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"068a6977-570a-4660-bbd4-c73ba15a6b0b","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"なるほど？ メインブランチが master か main なのかで名前に揺らぎがあるから、その差の吸収ということですかね。","ts":"1618920253.190300","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1618920288.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EzkJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bcaf019-b89f-40fb-9ad8-2738b837b9fa","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"この取り出しだと master とか main とかの名前で取れるんだけど、これが必要なのは、ローカルにある master や mainとの処理がしたいからだった。\nただ、本当はリモートがorigin打ち決めなのもよくないんだけど、そこは妥協してるんだったな","ts":"1618917858.190200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yTc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"731ba000-f6ff-4415-8f2a-bb57175c77fa","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー。思いだした。\norigin/HEADじゃない理由!","ts":"1618917798.189000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yU4M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83b0afb1-2e59-4541-b2f3-b7197d626dce","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"origin/HEADでもいいんだけど、どうしたもんかな","ts":"1618916901.188500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5mMJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ab218e0-5ec6-421b-8505-3062e87778ca","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分がやってる(まだkeep-baseははいってない)やつ\n```default-branch = \"!basename \\\"$(git symbolic-ref --short refs/remotes/origin/HEAD)\\\"\"\nbranch-root = !git merge-base $(git default-branch) HEAD\nfixing = \"!f () {\\\n\tif [ \\\"${#}\\\" -eq 1 ]; then\\\n\t\tGIT_SEQUENCE_EDITOR=':' git rebase -i ${*};\\\n\telse\\\n\t\tGIT_SEQUENCE_EDITOR=':' git rebase -i $(git branch-root);\\\n\tfi;\\\n};f\"```\nmaster/mainを default-branch で取り、それから分岐元を branch-root で取り、それをもって POSIX shellで処理のパスになる \":\" をeditorにして、 git rebase -i する、ということをしています。","ts":"1618916776.187900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CQXX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50112931-8dae-433f-ae4e-7ff9b173fd14","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ちゃんと読んでないけど rebase を即座にパスしたいなら editor は `true` とかで大丈夫","ts":"1618915538.185700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":2,"users":["UPWFF5YQ7","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CBL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f9b83d4-f175-49f7-9265-d26decad2af8","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"`git rev-parse origin/HEAD` と `git rev-parse $(git symbolic-ref --short refs/remotes/origin/HEAD)`  は常に等価になる気がするのですが、\nそうじゃないということですかね？\n`origin/HEAD` を refs 参照で見るのが symbolic-ref の方なのかなと","ts":"1618914838.185000","thread_ts":"1618914838.185000","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rP0D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"902be5f9-a3c4-49c1-bd3f-3627f7ff3484","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"基本的にmain or master","ts":"1618914305.182300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wc0ki"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bbc489a-bcfe-4727-bba7-a3e47be966d8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`basename \"$(git symbolic-ref --short refs/remotes/origin/HEAD)\"` は過去にtipsされたbase branch返すやつですね","ts":"1618914299.182100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/ImY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6a42309-5db8-46f7-9f79-7e088cfae40a","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"すみません。コマンドの意味を私が理解できていないのだと思います…\n`git symbolic-ref --short refs/remotes/origin/HEAD)`\nと\n`origin/HEAD` って、\n（参照先のコミットは）等価ではないということですかね？","ts":"1618914238.181500","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1618914270.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"782Qw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"947e560f-4ea4-4a54-82fd-a36edc9f231d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そうですね、push済みを最終的にrebaseするのはありえると思うので","ts":"1618914152.180200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MaTW3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3caa2f04-3a81-46d7-926d-036c39727e78","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"memo\n\u003chttps://scrapbox.io/yyano/fixup%E3%82%84squash%E3%82%92%E5%8F%8D%E6%98%A0%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F%E3%81%84%E3%81%A8%E3%81%8D%E3%81%AErebase%E3%82%92%E4%BE%BF%E5%88%A9%E3%81%AB%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B|https://scrapbox.io/yyano/fixup%E3%82%84squash%E3%82%92%E5%8F%8D%E6%98%A0%E3%81%97[…]%AErebase%E3%82%92%E4%BE%BF%E5%88%A9%E3%81%AB%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B\u003e","ts":"1618914116.179800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Yuki Yano's project: fixupやsquashを反映したいときのrebaseを便利にする - Yuki Yano's project","id":1,"title":"fixupやsquashを反映したいときのrebaseを便利にする - Yuki Yano's project","title_link":"https://scrapbox.io/yyano/fixup%E3%82%84squash%E3%82%92%E5%8F%8D%E6%98%A0%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F%E3%81%84%E3%81%A8%E3%81%8D%E3%81%AErebase%E3%82%92%E4%BE%BF%E5%88%A9%E3%81%AB%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B","text":"結論 $ GIT_EDITOR=cat git rebase --interactive --autosquash --keep-base $(git basebranch) basebranch以外を使う時は適宜変更 git basebranchはgitconfigで設定したalias basebranch = !\"basename \\\"$(git symbolic-ref --short re","thumb_url":"https://scrapbox.io/assets/img/content-logo.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Yuki Yano's project","service_icon":"https://scrapbox.io/assets/img/favicon/apple-touch-icon.png","thumb_width":288,"thumb_height":288,"from_url":"https://scrapbox.io/yyano/fixup%E3%82%84squash%E3%82%92%E5%8F%8D%E6%98%A0%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F%E3%81%84%E3%8