block_id":"/b0EH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d82dca5-c462-4da7-b5d9-312087e5862e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"GIT_EDITORでいけるのかな","ts":"1618913392.177100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D1nL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e55f8e3-9c79-49e6-9568-1bb743c4d28e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"もう1つ質問なんですが、core.editorで指定したエディタをワンタイムで書き換えることってできるでしょうか","ts":"1618913363.176800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VlGqy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48274a3c-d7df-4359-bf31-dae21468b38f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"へえ、editとは違うんだ?\nrebase interactiveはファイル名がrebase-todoだったっけ? だからかな?","ts":"1618913237.176200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UPWFF5YQ7"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fNL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d11e0115-c83d-4a76-845f-d60ab9e7b4ea","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"関係ないですが、いまおまけで help 見てたら `--edit-todo` なるオプションを知りました。（有名？）\nインタラクティブモードで rebase 中に、またインタラクティブな rebase 編集画面？を出せました（the todo list と表現されている）","ts":"1618913101.175400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SuA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da22f410-6af4-42f3-b0d9-dbcbba336f7c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ですね","ts":"1618912862.173300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"etM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbe16d65-895e-4e7d-852d-bd7ee0b28096","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、分岐元からrebaseでfixup反映したいのか","ts":"1618912817.172900","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1618912823.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qt9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db7f8778-3e07-4d0a-bea5-f7de6bc040dd","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あれ、でもrebaseの対象にしたいの(fixup?)はmainの分岐点(merge-base)の次じゃないの?","ts":"1618912778.172500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fd6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca595abf-c3cc-4bc5-82e0-cb4f5cdab598","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"おー、そんなオプションが","ts":"1618912754.172000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sqWU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbb9e051-07aa-46cc-9d8e-d01119dc581a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そんなオプションが","ts":"1618912736.171800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rlsK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fac87340-6f3f-4652-841c-a5872200fe04","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"お","ts":"1618912732.171600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fZt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8e00b32-624d-4290-818f-5aea59b82118","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"\u0026gt; This option is useful in the case where one is developing a feature on top of an upstream branch. While the feature is being worked on, the upstream branch may advance and it may not be the best idea to keep rebasing on top of the upstream but to keep the base commit as-is.\nまさになユースケース","ts":"1618912592.171400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2xcaC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd03fb2d-eb13-464d-aed2-cf15871cf0fe","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"あ\n今 help 見たら\n```git rebase -i --keep-base main```\nでいけるみたいで、やってみたらいけました。","ts":"1618912520.170900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7UV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5fa73780-b6d6-4551-b7b9-60fcda8c8892","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"ちょっと長いですがね。。","ts":"1618912397.170000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QBH3+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf7a254e-f2bd-4b7a-a14c-77d880005027","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"お、これでいける気がする","ts":"1618912354.169700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VVDT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95611882-66ce-427b-8c5b-a7db433f5e33","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"かなぁ","ts":"1618912274.169500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2YE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd112d1e-eddf-4ceb-81e3-7eec286c7583","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"```git rebase -i $(git merge-base master HEAD)```","ts":"1618912272.169300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DezT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7037b936-fa27-4e31-8dc0-3685006ecad5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"どうしたらいいんだこれ","ts":"1618912223.169000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RN8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f9def12-c2fe-4a96-8e10-5ff07a2f0e14","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ただこれ実現できたとして最初のcommitを起点にしてfixupしたい場合に、対象のcommitを指すことができなくてfixupできないですよね","ts":"1618912206.168500","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1618912218.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LkK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e68e493-cfdc-4754-95dc-cdac314f88fa","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今自分も試してました、取り込むっぽいですね","ts":"1618912181.167800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"auo7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38f4afcf-b337-4cd4-9780-601ec288b932","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"ごめんなさい。いまやったらガッツリ取り込みました。","ts":"1618912162.167300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QPP+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbc7c3ba-16a4-4dd7-8df4-c9ee49ad6aac","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、interactiveで落しまくればまあできはしますな、長いとツラいとは思いますが","ts":"1618912031.166800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hRZd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14047d62-5aa8-46cc-b8c7-055d9c08ccf1","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"あれ\n間違えてる？","ts":"1618912019.166500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RX94b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8f904ff-ea51-4fd4-8344-17e730607135","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"\u0026gt; あれ、rebase -i mainってmainの取り込みは行われないんでしたっけ\n~取り込まないですね。~\n~main と現在の HEAD の共通祖先から、現在の HEAD までを interactive に rebase できます。~\nすみません。がっつり取り込んでました。","ts":"1618911996.166200","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1618912151.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"74L9x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e814468-d5a0-4373-80b0-13f3e21671e2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"`git log HEAD...master -1 --right --pretty=%H`\nかな?","ts":"1618911995.166100","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1618912055.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"30HM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bfd1617-7a9e-4c27-a55d-28ec7da93260","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"リベースで指定しているなら、mainの先頭に繋ぐように調整しちゃうから、たぶんだめだろうけど...\n\u003chttps://git-scm.com/docs/git-log#Documentation/git-log.txt---left-only\u003e\n上のとこれ(かright)を組合せて、最初の1コミットを抽出するのは不可能じゃないと思う","ts":"1618911902.164500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zh46U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79afe792-9be8-411a-a379-e6846bae003d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そもそもそこ勘違いしてたかもしれない","ts":"1618911846.163500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I2=e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b64b080-c51f-4e0c-956b-b8e90fa542f0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あれ、rebase -i mainってmainの取り込みは行われないんでしたっけ","ts":"1618911825.162700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ooV9B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c47a1c3e-ed34-437a-ba5c-628e80f3b795","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、トリプルじゃないとだめかな?","ts":"1618911820.162600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vpCS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34fae1d1-bd82-46b6-bc30-010af9d38353","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"main を取り込まないのであれば\n`git rebase -i main` てやれば、main..HEAD 間のコミットで rebase を編集できる気がしますが、そういうのではない？","ts":"1618911803.162100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hn+d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b4cd83a-49ad-400d-a38d-b40892d2349a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://qiita.com/mhimuro/items/e225d26f6b59aeed2e27#%E3%83%80%E3%83%96%E3%83%AB%E3%83%89%E3%83%83%E3%83%88\u003e\nこれとlogの数指定でなんとか?","ts":"1618911800.161800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: git log 頻出オプション - Qiita","id":1,"title":"git log 頻出オプション - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/mhimuro/items/e225d26f6b59aeed2e27#%E3%83%80%E3%83%96%E3%83%AB%E3%83%89%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","text":"git logは編集履歴を見るためだけで、ざっくり使っていたので まとめて見ました。ProGitの焼き増し的な内容です。 git log --oneline 履歴をSHA-1の短縮表記とコミットコメントのみを表示します。 短縮表...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026w=1200\u0026mark=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D380%26txt%3Dgit%2520log%2520%25E9%25A0%25BB%25E5%2587%25BA%25E3%2582%25AA%25E3%2583%2597%25E3%2582%25B7%25E3%2583%25A7%25E3%2583%25B3%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D54%26txt-clip%3Dellipsis%26txt-align%3Dcenter%252Cmiddle%26s%3Dcdbb25fc2431613686cbc808951dce4b\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D500%26txt%3D%2540mhimuro%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D45%26txt-align%3Dright%252Cbottom%26s%3Dbf83e517ddfce3851d067d0d699a821c\u0026blend-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend-mode=normal\u0026s=2b966cf17e7e622a6d124cbd82dc58ae","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/mhimuro/items/e225d26f6b59aeed2e27#%E3%83%80%E3%83%96%E3%83%AB%E3%83%89%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","original_url":"https://qiita.com/mhimuro/items/e225d26f6b59aeed2e27#%E3%83%80%E3%83%96%E3%83%AB%E3%83%89%E3%83%83%E3%83%88"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BJ6L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d677f0e-d360-4d55-b38e-cb9c4591e18a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なら、共通の親までのlogをとって、自分の側にないのを出させればいいのかな?\nそれならなんかあった気がする","ts":"1618911721.160800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y/NeW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f43915e-19b1-4adc-ae68-42141dc21420","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あー、というか目的に沿えば何でもよくてmainを取り込まないfixupやsquashをするだけのrebaseってどうにかできないのかって意図です","ts":"1618911702.160300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oZc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34284dd8-e660-44fa-9448-7d2719a780f5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"mainからbranchを切ってからの最初のcommitが取れれば目的達成できる気がしている","ts":"1618911664.159400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qq6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d39b976-0aed-4559-8b50-42b4bc548504","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"current branchについてですね","ts":"1618911624.158600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZeA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"750fe609-c820-42fa-b3a7-7fee62843b28","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"\u0026gt; base branchの次\nいろんな「次」があるので、決められないのですよね。\n「次」を持ってるブランチはわかるのですか？","ts":"1618911607.158300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p9i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a673a06c-d2b4-4d44-8e2b-0a9eec1e4edb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"choさんも言ってるけどGitの構造は単方向リンクリストなので無理そう","ts":"1618911554.157500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4bQP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c49e5ce1-d641-40f3-9abb-8e32b7bbb661","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"厳しそうなのは分かってて、git rebase HEAD^^みたいなのでbase branchの次を探したいんですよね・・・","ts":"1618911549.157400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NhFA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d27de551-755c-4f52-baee-ea2bad59d8b3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"指し示すだけなら、そのときのコミットハッシュを即値はできるだろうけど、履歴は過去はあっても未来は固定じゃない(存在しないかもだし)、あったっけ?","ts":"1618911507.156200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Osv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b81a54c7-6f68-4395-be68-e57aa9a0a24b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"リベースだとそれは無理なんじゃ?","ts":"1618911470.155300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aJ05"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a21bbafc-6ee4-4d58-a55e-be22fd69c1de","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"logを辿るときに特定のポイントから次のコミットを指すみたいなことってできるでしょうか\n具体的にはfooブランチにいるときにmainを取り込まないようにしつつ `git rebase main@{next}` みたいなのをしたい場合","ts":"1618911412.154800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2+ro"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9304ca3c-ece0-4e83-b5a0-cc42d752d01d","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"一応補足すると\n\norigin/HEAD\nrefs/remotes/origin/HEAD\nは等価（糖衣構文）で\nHEAD の中身は refs/heads/main とかシンボリックリンク的なパスをもってるだけなので、\n\nsymbolic-ref コマンドで形式を直さなくても、指してるコミットは一致するかなと思ってます。","ts":"1618915967.185800","thread_ts":"1618914838.185000","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1618915987.000000"},"parent_user_id":"UPWFF5YQ7","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PXd"}]}]
